		new("renaissance_institution_academic_robe", "robe", "a long $colour academic robe", "This long robe is made from dense $colour broadcloth and hangs open down the front. Its full sleeves descend from reinforced shoulders, with broad folds gathering where they join the body. Flat facings finish the open edges, and a deep turned hem gives the lower panels an even fall. The close, smooth surface is unadorned, without an attached hood, fur border or badge identifying a particular institution.", SizeCategory.Normal, ItemQuality.Good, 1200.0, 120.0m, true, "broadcloth", ["Era / Renaissance Era", "Market / Clothing / Religious Clothing", "Institution / Religious"], ["Holdable", "Destroyable_Clothing", "Wear_Long_Open_Robe", "Armour_LightClothing", "Insulation_Moderate", "Variable_Colour"], "Canonical Renaissance stock item with an authored full description."),
