		new("renaissance_shared_clothing_leather_gloves", "gloves", "a pair of $colour leather gloves", "Fine $colour leather is cut into these close-fitting gloves, with separate fingers and neatly shaped thumbs. Small seams follow the outer edges of the fingers, turning inward where they join the palms. The short cuffs finish just beyond the wrists, their narrow hems lying flat against the softer inner face of the hide. Across the backs, the supple leather shows its natural grain and fine creases without a padded lining.", SizeCategory.Small, ItemQuality.Standard, 220, 21.0m, true, "leather", ["Era / Renaissance Era", "Market / Clothing / Standard Clothing"], ["Holdable", "Destroyable_Clothing", "Wear_Gloves", "Armour_LightClothing", "Insulation_Minor", "Variable_LeatherColour"], "Canonical Renaissance stock item with an authored full description."),
