		new("earlymodern_footwear_indianocean_ropesole_deckshoes", "shoes", "a pair of $colour rope-soled canvas shoes", "These low shoes have pliable $colour canvas uppers drawn over flat soles of closely coiled rope. Small stitches hold the coils together and fasten the turned-in cloth along their outer edges. The toes are rounded, and the sides rise only a little above the foot before ending in narrow bound openings. Coarse fibres remain visible along the sole edges, beneath the tighter weave of the unadorned uppers.", SizeCategory.Small, ItemQuality.Standard, 420, 30.0m, true, "canvas", ["Era / Early Modern Era", "Functions / Worn Items / Footwear", "Market / Clothing / Maritime Clothing"], ["Holdable", "Destroyable_Clothing", "Wear_Shoes", "Armour_LightClothing", "Insulation_Minor", "Variable_Colour"], "Canonical Renaissance stock item with an authored full description."),
