		new("earlymodern_religious_zoroastrian_kusti", "kusti", "a $colour wool kusti", "Fine strands of $colour wool are closely worked into this long, narrow girdle. The cord has a supple, slightly textured surface and an even thickness through most of its length. Its ends divide into small tasselled bundles, with the strands gathered tightly before they spread loose. There is no buckle or metal fitting; the light cord is long enough to wind around the waist and secure by tying.", SizeCategory.Small, ItemQuality.Good, 65, 32.0m, true, "wool", ["Era / Early Modern Era", "Market / Religious Goods / Ritual Supplies"], ["Holdable", "Destroyable_Misc", "Wear_Sash", "Variable_Colour"], "Canonical Renaissance stock item with an authored full description."),
