		new("medieval_latin_stole", "stole", "a $colour silk stole", "This $colour silk stole is a long, narrow band of cloth with neatly weighted ends and a smooth lustre. The silk catches light along its length, making the $colour tone appear richer where the fabric bends. Its construction is formal and restrained, with straight edges and a clearly ceremonial fall.", SizeCategory.Small, ItemQuality.Good, 110.0, 50.0m, true, "silk", ["Market / Clothing / Luxury Clothing", "Functions / Worn Items / Bodywear"], ["Holdable", "Wear_Scarf", "Destroyable_Clothing", "Insulation_Moderate", "Armour_LightClothing", "Variable_FineColour"], "Early Modern admission of an exact Medieval clothing definition."),
