		new("renaissance_frontier_split_skirt_riding_boots", "boots", "a pair of stiff high $colour leather boots", "These high boots have firm $colour leather shafts above rounded feet and thick, closely stitched soles. The upper edges flare slightly into broad cuffs, while long seams follow the backs of the legs toward the heels. Dense leather keeps the shafts upright, with deeper folds forming where they meet the insteps. The smooth outer panels are plainly finished, and the low heels are built from closely stacked layers.", SizeCategory.Small, ItemQuality.Good, 1220, 151.0m, true, "leather", ["Era / Renaissance Era", "Market / Clothing / Luxury Clothing"], ["Holdable", "Destroyable_Clothing", "Wear_High_Boots", "Armour_LightClothing", "Insulation_Minor", "Variable_LeatherColour"], "Canonical Renaissance stock item with an authored full description."),
