		new("renaissance_shared_clothing_soft_slippers", "slippers", "a pair of soft $colour leather slippers", "These low slippers have soft $colour leather uppers with rounded toes and shallow, closed backs. Each opening is edged by a narrow folded binding, following an uninterrupted curve around the foot. Flexible leather soles are stitched closely to the uppers, leaving only a small raised seam along the sides. The unlined interiors reveal the softer face of the hide, while the outside retains a fine, even grain.", SizeCategory.Small, ItemQuality.Standard, 650, 33.0m, true, "leather", ["Era / Renaissance Era", "Market / Clothing / Standard Clothing"], ["Holdable", "Destroyable_Clothing", "Wear_Shoes", "Armour_LightClothing", "Insulation_Minor", "Variable_LeatherColour"], "Canonical Renaissance stock item with an authored full description."),
